  <Title type="string">Notes on silence, in three coats of varnish</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Tenzin Rautenbach talks about the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding. Background noise: a gallery fan, rain, and someone hammering a nail into a work in progress.</synopsis>
